# Google Maps Platform API Key
# Never commit your real .env file or hardcode keys in source files.
#
# Option 1 (Prototyping — Free, Zero Billing Required):
#   1. Open https://mapsplatform.google.com/maps-demo-key?utm_campaign=gmp_git_agentsamples_v1.0.0
#   2. Sign in with any Google account (no billing card required)
#   3. Accept the Maps Demo Project Terms and generate your demo key
#   4. Copy .env.example to .env and paste your key below
#
# Option 2 (Production — Google Cloud Console):
#   1. Create or select a project at https://console.cloud.google.com/google/maps-apis/credentials?utm_campaign=gmp_git_agentsamples_v1.0.0
#   2. Enable: Maps JavaScript API, Places API (New), Routes API, and Roads API
#   3. Restrict your key by HTTP referrer (web) and API restrictions
#
GOOGLE_MAPS_API_KEY=your_google_maps_api_key_here
